{"name":"Limone","hex":"#d6c443","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Wedding Peach","blocks":[{"text":"Wedding Peach  is a Japanese manga written by Sukehiro Tomita and illustrated by Nao Yazawa that was originally serialized in Shogakukan's Ciao magazine. In North America, it was translated and published by VIZ Media in its entirety, consisting of six volumes. The manga was later adapted into an anime television series directed by Kunihiko Yuyama that ran for 51 episodes on TV Tokyo, from April 5, 1995, to March 27, 1996, as well as two omake, Ai Tenshi Robot Wedding Peach and Ai Tenshi Sentai and a four-episode OVA sequel in 1996."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b7/Wedding_Peach_manga_vol_1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedding_Peach"},{"title":"Limone sul Garda","blocks":[{"text":"Limone sul Garda is a town and comune in the province of Brescia, in Lombardy, at the western bank of Lake Garda."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Limone_sul_garda_visto_dal_battello.jpg/330px-Limone_sul_garda_visto_dal_battello.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limone_sul_Garda"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.jpg/250px-Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.jpg/500px-Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.jpg/250px-Gardasee%2C_Lago_di_Garda_-_panoramio_%288%29.j